v1_7 (Nov 10, 2006)

The pixel flats "pixflatave-53981-*.fits" were added to changes in the
b1 & b2 PR 6650 contamination which happened after the cameras were
warmed/pumped/cooled again over the 2006 shutdown. There is some
thought that the cameras had been cooled down in a hurry (i.e. without
extensive post-shutdown pumping) over the 2005 shutdown. The cameras
were well pumped over the 2006 shutdown, and the new flats look much
closer to the v1_5 flats.  Built from five nights of dithered flats:
53999, 54022, 54023, 54024, 54027. All were taken with 15-position
sweeps; some were taken with 3 esposures per position; three different
cartridges were used.
The new flats are backdated to shortly after the shutdown.

